---
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
---
<section class="brands-manifesto">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHead eyebrow="working with us" html="For brands" />
    <div class="brands-narrow">
      <p>We work with brands when it makes the reading better for the people who show up. A few have come along already — Audible, Penguin, Third Wave Coffee, Crossword, Socials — each one added something a Sunday already wanted: more books, a roof when it rains, an audiobook offer for the people who can't always come in person, a coffee table to lean on.</p>
      <p>Sundays are free and stay free. The reader doesn't pay to attend, ever. Everything we do with a brand sits around that.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
